<title>UK: Rabobank sets warrants on five German stocks.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets warrants on five German stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rabobank Deutschland says it has issued 47.5 million call and put warrants, in 19 equal tranches, on five German stocks.</p>
<p>There are five tranches on Schering AG (three tranches of calls and two tranches of puts), five tranches on Thyssen AG (three tranches of calls and two tranches of puts), three tranches on Continental AG (two tranches of calls and one of puts), three tranches on RWE AG (two tranches of calls and one of puts) and three tranches on Henkel KGaA (two tranches of calls and one of puts).</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   30.DEC.98		 PAYDATE	21.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  RBSK</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
